  },"decision":{"summary":"Two nodes (node-13le0vv and node-1bwsi59) are unsupported because they assert gaps without evidence of absence. Node-1j1lziw is supported by direct shift-log text.","evidenceUsed":["24ec1587-92e9-4320-82c2-30368d834f1d#1","fcd254db-75b3-4a9d-abec-44c5b6a9b34e#1"],"unknowns":["Whether a P-R reading exists at 09:45 AM.","What specific equipment or process condition caused the air-low indication."],"alternatives":["The pressure extract may be incomplete; other records could contain missing measurements.","A witness statement might identify an unlogged cause of interruption. The shift log entry 'About 10:07' indicates restoration but does not confirm whether a formal root-cause analysis was performed before work resumed.","No evidence exists to support claims about communication breakdown or procedural violations beyond what is explicitly recorded."],"confidence":0.85}}
